 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>! aa001c was a CONSTRAINED optimization (IFZMAT distance restraints             
 INPUT CARD>! holding the incoming water 1.2 A from the hydrate), used to generate a        
 INPUT CARD>! good TS-like starting structure -- exactly mirroring how caa005b.log          
